{
  "_readme": [
    "Shadow-only owner strategy. Copy to user-config.json and edit.",
    "ownerStrategy is the single parameter block. Omitted keys fall back to strategy/defaults.js.",
    "This build forces shadow mode and DRY_RUN=true. It does not load walletKey.",
    "The volume profile is a TradingView visible-range VPVR equivalent built from 1440 one-minute bars.",
    "candleProvider none fails closed. gmgn and the stubbed birdeye adapter are selectable.",
    "Fabriq HOT is a separate trigger. It uses the same entry filters and does not replace the two-wallet rule.",
    "crashGuard rejects a SOL price more than maxDrawdownPct below the lookback high. poolDepth rejects a pool whose own 5m volume divided by its liquidity exceeds maxVolToLiq5m.",
    "autoCompound.execute and reshapeLiquidity.execute default to false. A live send also needs shadowMode false, dry-run off, and a wallet key. Otherwise the shadow simulation runs and nothing is built or sent.",
    "autoCompound.bands place token fees and SOL fees by the percent the quote price sits below the upper edge. requireFeesExceedCostX 0 leaves the cost multiple off. A curve compound can profit-take after curveProfitTake.binsUp.",
    "reshapeLiquidity.mode one_side reshapes only the token side on a dump and only the SOL side on a pump. both_sides redistributes the whole range.",
    "The first Fabriq poll ignores posts older than pollSec*3. staleAfterSec ends an open pursuit that gets no newer alert.",
    "Do not put a private key in this file."
  ],
